        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Parliamentary democracy</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1721 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Power held by</span><span class="info-stat-val">A prime minister and cabinet who command a majority in the elected lower house; a monarch or president serves as a largely ceremonial head of state</span></div>
